## Properties of the reference formulas (derived by evaluation)
EKFC Q at age 25 (F): polynomial 62.43 umol/L vs adult constant 62 -> eGFR step at 25->25+ for Scr above Q: x0.9922
EKFC Q at age 25 (M): polynomial 80.86 umol/L vs adult constant 80 -> eGFR step at 25->25+ for Scr above Q: x0.9879
CKD-EPI 2021 continuous at the knee: True; strictly decreasing in Scr on 0.30-5.29 mg/dL: True
CKD-EPI 2021 strictly decreasing in age 18-100: True; EKFC age factor flat to 40 then 0.990/yr

